  "rows": [
    {
      "block": "p0187#1",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "方便的，但并不是必须这样做. 可以对电势(8-28)或(8-29)",
      "printedRow": 1,
      "sourceYBand": [
        240,
        281
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#1",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 2,
      "text": "附加一个任意常数. 这样，电场中任意两点之间的电势差并",
      "printedRow": 2,
      "sourceYBand": [
        308,
        350
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#1",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 3,
      "text": "没有改变，而正是电势差才具有实际意义.",
      "printedRow": 3,
      "sourceYBand": [
        383,
        422
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#2",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "如果取无限远的点的电势为零，则点电荷 $q_1$ 的电场的电",
      "printedRow": 4,
      "sourceYBand": [
        452,
        491
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#2",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 2,
      "text": "势具有简单的物理意义. 把 $U_2=0$ 代到公式(8-27)中，则得",
      "printedRow": 5,
      "sourceYBand": [
        521,
        561
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#3",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "$U_1=\\frac{A}{q}=\\frac{q_1}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r}$.",
      "printedRow": 6,
      "sourceYBand": [
        615,
        689
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#4",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "因此，**距离点电荷 $q_1$ 为 $r$ 处的电势，在数值上等于单位正电",
      "printedRow": 7,
      "sourceYBand": [
        732,
        774
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#4",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 2,
      "text": "荷从空间中的该点移到无限远处时电场所做的功 $A$.**",
      "printedRow": 8,
      "sourceYBand": [
        802,
        846
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#5",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "公式(8-28)和(8-29)，对于距离均匀带电球大于它的半",
      "printedRow": 9,
      "sourceYBand": [
        875,
        917
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#5",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 2,
      "text": "径的地方的电势，也是正确的，因为均匀带电球在它外面和在",
      "printedRow": 10,
      "sourceYBand": [
        944,
        989
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#5",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 3,
      "text": "它表面上所产生的电场，与放在球心的点电荷的电场是一",
      "printedRow": 11,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1015,
        1059
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#5",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 4,
      "text": "致的.",
      "printedRow": 12,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1086,
        1124
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#6",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "我们讨论了点电荷电场的电势. 可以把任何物体的电荷",
      "printedRow": 13,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1156,
        1202
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#6",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 2,
      "text": "想象地分成许多小的单元，每个小单元都是点电荷. 于是，场",
      "printedRow": 14,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1227,
        1274
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#6",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 3,
      "text": "中任意点的电势等于单个点电荷所产生的电势 $U_1$、$U_2$、$U_3$ 等",
      "printedRow": 15,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1297,
        1344
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#6",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 4,
      "text": "的总和：",
      "printedRow": 16,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1370,
        1407
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#7",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "$U=U_1+U_2+U_3+\\cdots\\cdots$. (8-30)",
      "printedRow": 17,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1444,
        1482
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#8",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "这个关系式是电场叠加原理的推论.",
      "printedRow": 18,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1512,
        1556
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#9",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "**两个点电荷相互作用的电势能** 知道点电荷电势的表示",
      "printedRow": 19,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1583,
        1629
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#9",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 2,
      "text": "式，可以计算出两个点电荷相互作用的电势能. 特别是，电子",
      "printedRow": 20,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1651,
        1699
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#9",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 3,
      "text": "与原子核的相互作用能.",
      "printedRow": 21,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1722,
        1764
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#10",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "在点电荷 $q_2$ 的电场中电荷 $q_1$ 的电势能，等于电荷 **$q_1$** 与",
      "printedRow": 22,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1794,
        1842
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#10",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 2,
      "text": "电荷 $q_2$ 的电势 $U$ 的乘积，$E_P=q_1U_q$.",
      "printedRow": 23,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1862,
        1907
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "p0187#11",
      "blockKind": "p",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "利用公式(8-29)，在 $\\varepsilon=1$ 的情况下，可以得到在静电单",
      "printedRow": 24,
      "sourceYBand": [
        1936,
        1984
      ]
    },
